<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- ================================================================
  EARTH ONE — CHANNEL TRAILER v2 — SCENE FILE
  One self-contained interactive HTML scene. This file is (a) the
  video's source — the MP4 is rendered from it frame by frame,
  (b) a playable sample anyone can open (file://, no server, no
  external references), and (c) the production context: every
  element's Decision Record lives in the #decisions data block
  below and in the on-page context panel.
  Decision coverage: 14 of 14 elements recorded · 0 undecided.
  ================================================================ -->
<html lang="en">
