   "alternatives": "(a) One compressed line with all three glosses \u2014 ran past 35 words and buried the channel name at the end of a subordinate pile-up. (b) Dropping the names ('our written series', 'our other channel') \u2014 rejected: the names are the routing; a viewer must be able to search the channel name. (c) v1's bare names \u2014 failed the gate.",
